ASTPP 6.1 - infrahost fork
==========================

This directory contains a modified version of ASTPP, the open source VoIP billing solution
by iNextrix Technologies Pvt. Ltd. (https://github.com/iNextrix/ASTPP, branch V6.0,
commit d5108ec6fb7a1ba7842155fb4e06632c629f3a63).

Modified by infrahost since 2026-10-08: security hardening, port to PHP 8.5, updated and
self-hosted third-party libraries, removal of telemetry, vendor advertising and dead code,
infrahost branding. Every change is recorded in the git history of this directory.

